==Battleground==
*1 [[Saber (Enemy)|Saber]] spawns after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Duche]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*4 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 76.67 seconds<sup>2,300f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*5 [[Duche]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 1.33~1.67 seconds<sup>40f~50f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Saber is outranged by [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]]. Simply clear out the Duches and Owlbrows by stacking [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cats]] to get clear sights on her, then go in for the kill.

